OL,3,GNEWSANine arrested after protest at
OL,4,Adrone factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FNine people opposed to Israel's
OL,7,Fmilitary action in Gaza have been
OL,8,Farrested after a protest at a drone
OL,9,Ffactory.
OL,11,FPolice were called to UAV Engines, a
OL,12,Fsubsidiary of Israeli firm Elbit
OL,13,FSystems, in Shenstone, Staffordshire,
OL,14,Fat 06:40 BST on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
