OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSANine arrested after protest at
OL,4,Adrone factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people were held on suspicion of
OL,7,Fthe charge of "lock on to
OL,8,Fperson/object/land to cause serious
OL,9,Fdisruption". They are two men aged 57
OL,10,Fand 73 from the Stroud area of
OL,11,FGloucestershire; a 39-year-old woman of
OL,12,Fno fixed address; and a 77-year-old man
OL,13,Ffrom the Bolton area.
OL,15,FA man, 55, of no fixed address, was
OL,16,Farrested on suspicion of wilful
OL,17,Fobstruction on a highway. Four others
OL,18,Fwere questioned on suspicion of both
OL,19,Foffences, Staffordshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
